# collisional_starburst_recipe with R3's flags (FIREmodeOn 1, R3.par:55; SFprescription 1, BulgeSizeOn 3, every other flag and parameter R2.par's): both caps binding and E_FB below E_lift by rounding alone: nothing ejected; ColdGas 0x3f000002 found by the same scan
# Built from the R3 central of Snap_32 row 4 (32 row 4 (GalaxyIndex 31, Type 0)), changing only what is named; MassLoading is a deliberately stale finite value the burst must leave unchanged (M:707-710).
# Reachability: constructed routine-domain probe.
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine collisional_starburst_recipe_fire

